<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "국토교통 데이터 카탈로그 확장 온톨로지"@ko, "MOLIT data catalogue extension ontology"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Release Candidate. Namespace publication, local-artifact licensing and owner approval remain pending."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "DCAT 3와 DCAT-AP 3.0.1에 없는 국토교통 카탈로그 의미를 최소 범위로 정의한다. 이 후보 온톨로지는 기관 승인, 제공 권한 또는 전송 가능성을 스스로 증명하지 않는다."@ko, "Defines the minimum MOLIT catalogue semantics not supplied by DCAT 3 and DCAT-AP 3.0.1. This candidate ontology does not by itself prove institutional approval, provider authority or transfer availability."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap/1.0.0-rc.1>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> _:n3-1417.
_:n3-1417 a <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "기관 식별자와 발행권한은 운영기관 승인을 기다린다. 이 blank node를 Provider authority 또는 권위 기관 IRI로 사용하지 않는다."@ko, "The organization identifier and publishing authority await operating-authority approval. This blank node is not a Provider authority or an authoritative organization IRI."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "국토교통부 발행주체 후보"@ko, "Candidate MOLIT publishing agent"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/type> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/agent-type/unverified-publisher>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/agent-type/unverified-publisher> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "unverified-publisher";
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "미승인 발행주체 후보"@ko, "Unverified candidate publisher"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "후보 artifact에 이름으로만 표시했으며 기관 식별자와 발행권한을 운영기관이 아직 승인하지 않은 발행주체 유형."@ko, "A publisher type used only by name on candidate artifacts where the operating authority has not yet approved an organization identifier or publishing authority."@en.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#TransferableDataset> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Operational eligibility is decided outside the metadata graph by an approved authority registry and runtime controls."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/deprecated>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "계약 또는 전송 절차에서 사용할 배포 설명을 하나 이상 가진 데이터셋. 이 유형의 선언만으로 현재 제공 권한, Connector 준비 상태 또는 전송 성공을 주장하지 않는다."@ko, "A dataset with one or more distribution descriptions intended for contract or transfer procedures. Declaring this type alone does not assert current provider authority, connector readiness or successful transfer."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> true;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "전송 설명이 있는 데이터셋"@ko, "Dataset with a transfer description"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "1.0.0-rc.1부터 신규 metadata에는 dcat:Dataset과 별도 molit:DataspaceOfferingMetadata를 사용한다. 기존 유형은 0.1.0 graph 읽기와 migration에만 보존한다."@ko, "From 1.0.0-rc.1, new metadata uses dcat:Dataset with a separate molit:DataspaceOfferingMetadata resource. This legacy type is retained only for reading and migrating 0.1.0 graphs."@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#DataspaceOfferingMetadata>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#DataspaceOfferingMetadata> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "데이터셋의 제공 의도, 준비상태와 자격 증거 참조를 기술하는 발견용 정보 객체. 이 객체는 DSP Offer, Agreement 또는 운영 승인 자체가 아니다."@ko, "A discovery information object describing an intention to offer a dataset, its readiness and references to qualification evidence. It is not itself a DSP Offer, Agreement or operational approval."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Resource>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "데이터 스페이스 제공 메타데이터"@ko, "Dataspace offering metadata"@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/deprecated> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/term-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "사용 중단"@ko, "Deprecated"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "신규 데이터에 사용하지 않으며 대체 용어 또는 tombstone 설명을 유지하는 상태."@ko, "No longer used for new data, while a replacement term or tombstone explanation is retained."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/term-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/term-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#SpatialDataset> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "공간 범위 또는 지오메트리와 그 해석에 필요한 좌표참조체계를 기술하는 데이터셋."@ko, "A dataset describing a spatial extent or geometry and the coordinate reference system needed to interpret it."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "공간 데이터셋"@ko, "Spatial dataset"@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkDataset> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "도로, 철도, 정류장, 링크 또는 노드와 같이 판이 바뀔 수 있는 교통망 요소를 기술하는 공간 데이터셋."@ko, "A spatial dataset describing versioned transport-network elements such as roads, railways, stops, links or nodes."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#SpatialDataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 데이터셋"@ko, "Transport network dataset"@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#ObservationDataset> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The class describes catalogue metadata for a dataset. It is not declared equivalent to a SOSA observation or observation collection."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통량, 속도, 통행시간 또는 시설 상태처럼 시간에 따라 관측한 값을 제공하며 관측항목, 관측대상 유형, 집계, 결측 처리와 단위를 함께 기술하는 데이터셋."@ko, "A dataset providing time-dependent observations such as traffic volume, speed, travel time or facility status, together with observed-property, subject-type, aggregation, missing-value and unit semantics."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "관측 데이터셋"@ko, "Observation dataset"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/ObservationCollection>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#TransferDistribution> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/deprecated>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "계약 절차에서 사용할 수 있는 파일 또는 고정 데이터 표현의 카탈로그 배포 설명. 실제 접근 승인과 일시적인 전송 주소는 운영 계층에서 별도로 판정한다."@ko, "A catalogue distribution description for a file or fixed data representation intended for a contract procedure. Actual access approval and transient transfer addresses are decided separately by the operational layer."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> true;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "전송 배포 설명"@ko, "Transfer distribution description"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "1.0.0-rc.1부터 신규 metadata에는 dcat:Distribution을 사용하고 제공 준비상태는 molit:DataspaceOfferingMetadata에서 분리한다. 기존 유형은 0.1.0 graph migration에만 보존한다."@ko, "From 1.0.0-rc.1, new metadata uses dcat:Distribution and records offering readiness separately on molit:DataspaceOfferingMetadata. This legacy type is retained only for migrating 0.1.0 graphs."@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#DataspaceOfferingMetadata>, <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "발급기관, 망 식별자, 판, 요소 유형, snapshot checksum과 생명주기를 한 판정 단위로 보존하는 참조 객체."@ko, "A reference object preserving issuing authority, network identifier, edition, element types, snapshot checksum and lifecycle as one resolution unit."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 참조"@ko, "Network reference"@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#QualityMappingStatement> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원천 품질 요소를 DQV metric으로 옮길 때 적용한 관계, 손실 처리와 역변환 가능성을 기록하는 명세."@ko, "A statement recording the relation, loss disposition and reversibility used when mapping a source quality element to a DQV metric."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "품질 매핑 명세"@ko, "Quality mapping statement"@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#networkReference> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "데이터셋을 교통망 식별체계와 판을 보존하는 참조 객체에 연결한다."@ko, "Links a dataset to the reference object preserving its transport-network identifier system and edition."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 참조"@ko, "network reference"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkDataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#networkAuthority> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통망 식별자와 판의 유일성 범위를 관리하는 발급기관."@ko, "The issuing authority governing the uniqueness scope of a transport-network identifier and edition."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 식별자 발급기관"@ko, "network identifier authority"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#networkIdentifier> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "발급기관의 범위 안에서 교통망 또는 식별자 체계를 식별하는 문자열."@ko, "A string identifying a transport network or identifier system within the issuing authority's scope."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 식별자"@ko, "network identifier"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#networkVersion> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "발급기관이 공개한 교통망 상태의 판 또는 snapshot 식별자. 소프트웨어 버전을 뜻하지 않는다."@ko, "The edition or snapshot identifier of a network state published by its authority; it is not a software version."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 판"@ko, "network edition"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#networkElementType> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "참조된 교통망에 포함되는 노드, 링크, 구간, 정류장 또는 시설의 유형."@ko, "The type of node, link, section, stop or facility included in the referenced transport network."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 요소 유형"@ko, "network element type"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#networkSnapshotChecksum> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통망 판을 구성하는 고정 배포물 또는 승인 manifest의 byte 동일성을 확인하는 SHA-256 체크섬 값. 알고리즘은 이 release에서 SHA-256으로 고정한다."@ko, "A SHA-256 checksum value used to verify the byte identity of the fixed distribution or approved manifest constituting a network edition. This release fixes the algorithm to SHA-256."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 snapshot 체크섬"@ko, "network snapshot checksum"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#hexBinary>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#networkLifecycleStatus> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통망 판이 후보, 현행, 대체됨 또는 철회됨 중 어느 상태인지 나타내는 통제값."@ko, "A controlled value stating whether a network edition is a candidate, current, superseded or withdrawn."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 판 생명주기 상태"@ko, "network-edition lifecycle status"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#networkValidFrom> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "해당 교통망 판을 식별자 해석과 조인에 사용하기 시작하는 날짜."@ko, "The date from which the network edition is used for identifier resolution and joins."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 판 유효 시작"@ko, "network-edition valid from"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#networkValidUntil> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "해당 교통망 판을 현행 판으로 해석하는 마지막 날짜. 값이 없으면 종료일을 아직 정하지 않은 것이다."@ko, "The last date on which the network edition is interpreted as current; absence means that no end date has yet been assigned."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "교통망 판 유효 종료"@ko, "network-edition valid until"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#NetworkReference>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#observedProperty> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "데이터셋에 수록된 값이 측정하거나 판정한 현상 또는 특성의 종류."@ko, "The kind of phenomenon or characteristic measured or assessed by values contained in the dataset."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "관측항목"@ko, "observed property"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observedProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#ObservationDataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#observationSubjectType> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "관측값이 적용되는 지점, 구간, 망 요소, 시설, 차량 집단 또는 지역의 유형."@ko, "The type of site, section, network element, facility, vehicle population or area to which observations apply."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "관측대상 유형"@ko, "observation subject type"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#ObservationDataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#observationAggregation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원 관측값을 순간값, 합계, 평균, 최솟값, 최댓값 또는 중앙값으로 구성한 방식을 나타내는 통제값."@ko, "A controlled value stating whether source observations are represented as instantaneous values, sums, means, minima, maxima or medians."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "관측 집계방식"@ko, "observation aggregation method"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#ObservationDataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#aggregationPeriod> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "하나의 집계값을 계산하는 시간창의 길이. 데이터셋의 최소 시간해상도와 같다고 가정하지 않는다."@ko, "The duration of the time window used to calculate one aggregate value; it is not assumed to equal the dataset's minimum temporal resolution."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "관측 집계기간"@ko, "observation aggregation period"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#ObservationDataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#duration>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#missingValuePolicy> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "누락된 관측을 원자료 결측 유지, 명시적 결측 코드, 집계 제외 또는 승인된 대치 중 어느 방식으로 처리했는지 나타내는 통제값."@ko, "A controlled value stating whether absent observations are preserved as missing, encoded explicitly, excluded from aggregation or replaced by an approved imputation method."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "결측값 처리정책"@ko, "missing-value policy"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#ObservationDataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#observationUnit> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "관측값의 수치 의미를 해석하는 QUDT 단위. 품질 측정값의 단위와 구분한다."@ko, "The QUDT unit used to interpret observation values; it is distinct from the unit of a quality measurement."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "관측값 단위"@ko, "observation-value unit"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#ObservationDataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#describesOfferingDataset> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "제공 메타데이터가 발견용으로 기술하는 데이터셋을 연결한다."@ko, "Links an offering-metadata resource to the dataset it describes for discovery."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "제공 대상 데이터셋"@ko, "describes offering dataset"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#DataspaceOfferingMetadata>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#offeringReadinessStatus> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "제공 후보가 metadata 작성, 외부 자격검토, 중단 또는 철회 중 어느 단계에 있는지 나타내는 통제값."@ko, "A controlled value stating whether an offering candidate is being described, awaiting external qualification, suspended or withdrawn."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "제공 준비상태"@ko, "offering readiness status"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#DataspaceOfferingMetadata>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#qualificationEvidence> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "제공 권한, 위임, 유효기간 또는 Connector 준비상태를 판단할 때 사용한 비공개 또는 공개 증거 객체의 참조. 참조의 존재만으로 증거의 진위를 보증하지 않는다."@ko, "A reference to a public or non-public evidence object used to assess provider authority, delegation, validity or connector readiness. Presence of the reference does not establish evidence authenticity."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "제공 자격 증거 참조"@ko, "qualification evidence reference"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#DataspaceOfferingMetadata>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#qualityStatus> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "데이터셋에 대한 품질 평가 절차의 진행 또는 판정 상태. 상태만으로 측정값이나 합격을 주장하지 않는다."@ko, "The progress or decision state of a quality-assessment procedure for a dataset; the status alone does not assert a measurement or a passing result."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "품질 평가 상태"@ko, "quality assessment status"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMeasurement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#qualityEvaluationMethod> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "품질 측정값을 산출한 평가방법 통제값을 연결한다. 세부 알고리즘과 매개변수는 해당 방법 문서의 판을 참조한다."@ko, "Links a quality measurement to a controlled evaluation-method value. Detailed algorithms and parameters refer to the applicable method-document edition."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "품질 평가 방법"@ko, "quality evaluation method"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#QualityMeasurement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#qualityEvaluationScope> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "품질 측정값을 Dataset 전체로 오해하지 않도록 실제 평가 모집단, 표본, 속성 또는 기간을 기술하는 문자열."@ko, "A string describing the evaluated population, sample, attribute or period so that a measurement is not mistaken for a whole-dataset result."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "품질 평가 범위"@ko, "quality evaluation scope"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#QualityMeasurement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#qualityResultKind> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "품질 결과가 수치, 논리, 범주 또는 서술 중 어느 표현을 사용하는지 나타내는 통제값."@ko, "A controlled value stating whether a quality result is quantitative, boolean, categorical or descriptive."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "품질 결과 유형"@ko, "quality result kind"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#QualityMeasurement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#qualityMappingStatement> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "품질 측정값을 원천 품질 요소, 대상 DQV metric, 손실 처리와 역변환 조건을 기록한 별도 매핑 명세에 연결한다."@ko, "Links a quality measurement to a separate mapping statement recording the source quality element, target DQV metric, loss disposition and reverse-mapping conditions."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "품질 매핑 명세"@ko, "quality mapping statement"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#QualityMeasurement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#QualityMappingStatement>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#sourceQualityElement> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "품질 매핑의 입력이 되는 원천 표준 또는 시스템의 품질 요소 식별자."@ko, "The identifier of a quality element in the source standard or system used as input to a quality mapping."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "원천 품질 요소"@ko, "source quality element"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#QualityMappingStatement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#mappedQualityMetric> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원천 품질 요소가 변환되는 DQV 품질 측정항목."@ko, "The DQV quality metric to which the source quality element is mapped."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "대상 품질 측정항목"@ko, "mapped quality metric"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#QualityMappingStatement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#Metric>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#qualityLossDisposition> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "품질 매핑이 무손실, 가역 손실, 비가역 손실, 미매핑 또는 게시 제외 중 어느 상태인지 나타내는 통제값."@ko, "A controlled value stating whether a quality mapping is lossless, reversibly lossy, irreversibly lossy, unmapped or excluded from publication."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "품질 매핑 손실 처리"@ko, "quality-mapping loss disposition"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#QualityMappingStatement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#qualityLossNote> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "대상 표현에서 보존되지 않는 원천 의미와 역변환 조건을 사람이 검토할 수 있도록 설명한 문장."@ko, "A human-reviewable statement explaining source semantics not preserved by the target representation and any reverse-mapping conditions."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "품질 매핑 손실 설명"@ko, "quality-mapping loss note"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#QualityMappingStatement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#spatialDisclosureLevel> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "공개 카탈로그에서 제공하는 공간 범위의 일반화 수준. 보안 등급이나 접근 권한을 대신하지 않는다."@ko, "The generalization level of a spatial extent exposed in a public catalogue; it does not replace a security classification or access right."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "공간 공개 정밀도"@ko, "spatial disclosure level"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Resource>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#requirementId> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "SHACL 제약을 사람이 읽는 명세와 시험 항목에 연결하는 안정 식별자."@ko, "A stable identifier linking a SHACL constraint to its human-readable specification and test cases."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "요구사항 식별자"@ko, "requirement identifier"@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#remediation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "제약 위반을 수정하기 위한 운영 지침."@ko, "Operational guidance for correcting a constraint violation."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "수정 지침"@ko, "remediation"@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap#controlOwner> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/def/molit-dcat-ap>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "제약의 의미와 변경을 관리하는 책임 역할 식별자."@ko, "An identifier for the role accountable for the meaning and change control of a constraint."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "통제 책임 역할"@ko, "control owner role"@en.
