    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "국토교통 데이터 주제 분류"@ko, "MOLIT data themes"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "국토, 도시, 주택, 건축, 부동산, 건설, 교통, 물류와 공간정보 Dataset을 발견하기 위한 국토교통 주제 후보 분류체계."@ko, "A candidate MOLIT theme scheme for discovering land, urban, housing, building, real-estate, construction, transport, logistics and geospatial datasets."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/domain/land>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/domain/transport>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/domain/spatial-information>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "License for locally authored concepts is pending owner approval."@en.
