    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "한국측지계 2002 동해원점 좌표계 2010(EPSG:5188)"@ko, "KGD2002 / East Sea Belt 2010 (EPSG:5188)"@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "품질 평가 상태"@ko;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "품질 평가 상태"@ko, "Quality assessment status"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Dataset 품질 평가 절차의 실행과 판정 상태를 표시하는 후보 분류체계. 상태값은 측정값이나 합격을 대신하지 않는다."@ko, "A candidate scheme for execution and decision states of dataset quality assessment; a status does not replace a measurement or passing decision."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/not-assessed>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/assessed>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/warning>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/failed>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/stale>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "License for locally authored concepts is pending owner approval."@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/not-assessed> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "미평가"@ko, "Not assessed"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "승인된 품질 평가 절차를 아직 실행하지 않은 상태."@ko, "No approved quality-assessment procedure has yet been run."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/assessed> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "평가 완료"@ko, "Assessed"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "승인된 품질 평가 절차를 완료한 상태. 우수 등급을 뜻하지 않는다."@ko, "An approved quality-assessment procedure is complete; this does not assert a high quality grade."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/warning> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "주의"@ko, "Warning"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "평가가 완료됐으나 하나 이상의 측정항목에 검토가 필요한 상태."@ko, "Assessment is complete, but one or more metrics require review."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/failed> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "기준 미달"@ko, "Failed"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "하나 이상의 필수 품질 기준을 충족하지 못한 상태."@ko, "One or more mandatory quality thresholds were not met."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/stale> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "최신성 만료"@ko, "Stale"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "품질 측정일이 운영 최신성 정책의 유효기간을 지난 상태."@ko, "The quality measurement date is outside the validity period set by the operating currency policy."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "국토교통 품질 측정항목"@ko;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "국토교통 품질 측정항목"@ko, "MOLIT quality metrics"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "국토교통 Dataset의 완전성, 위치·시간 정확도, 논리 일관성과 적시성을 DQV로 게시하기 위한 제한된 후보 측정항목 집합."@ko, "A limited candidate set of DQV metrics for publishing completeness, positional and temporal accuracy, logical consistency and timeliness of MOLIT datasets."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/completeness>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/positional-accuracy>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/temporal-accuracy>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/logical-consistency>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/timeliness>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "License for locally authored concepts is pending owner approval."@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/completeness> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#Metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "완전성"@ko, "Completeness"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "필수 레코드 또는 속성 중 값이 존재하고 유효한 항목의 비율. 0부터 100까지의 QUDT PERCENT로 기록한다."@ko, "The percentage of required records or attributes that are present and valid, expressed as QUDT PERCENT from 0 to 100."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/positional-accuracy> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#Metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "위치 정확도"@ko, "Positional accuracy"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "기준 위치와 관측 위치 사이의 비음수 오차를 미터로 나타낸 값. 값이 작을수록 오차가 작다."@ko, "A non-negative positional error between reference and observed positions in metres; a lower value means a smaller error."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/temporal-accuracy> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#Metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "시간 정확도"@ko, "Temporal accuracy"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "기준 시각과 기록 시각 사이의 비음수 절대 오차를 초로 나타낸 값."@ko, "A non-negative absolute error between reference and recorded time in seconds."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/logical-consistency> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#Metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "논리 일관성"@ko, "Logical consistency"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "적용한 논리 규칙 중 통과한 규칙의 비율. 0부터 100까지의 QUDT PERCENT로 기록한다."@ko, "The percentage of evaluated logical rules that passed, expressed as QUDT PERCENT from 0 to 100."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/metric/timeliness> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#Metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "적시성"@ko, "Timeliness"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원천 사건 또는 갱신 시각부터 공개 시각까지의 비음수 경과시간. 초·분·시간·일 단위를 사용하며 값이 작을수록 빠르다."@ko, "The non-negative elapsed time from a source event or update to publication, expressed in seconds, minutes, hours or days; a lower value is more timely."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-metric>.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PERCENT> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "percent"@en.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "metre"@en.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/SEC> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "second"@en.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MIN> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "minute"@en.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/HR> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hour"@en.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DAY> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "day"@en.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloM-PER-HR> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kilometre per hour"@en.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M-PER-SEC> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "metre per second"@en.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NUM-PER-HR> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "number per hour"@en.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NUM> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "number"@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "공간 공개 정밀도"@ko;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "공간 공개 정밀도"@ko, "Spatial disclosure levels"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "공개 카탈로그에 원 geometry를 어느 수준으로 일반화하거나 제거했는지 표시하는 후보 분류체계. 접근권한 또는 보안등급이 아니다."@ko, "A candidate scheme indicating how source geometry is generalized or removed in a public catalogue; it is not an access right or security classification."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/exact>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/generalized>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/administrative-area>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/bounding-box>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/grid>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/withheld>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "License for locally authored concepts is pending owner approval."@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/exact> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "원 정밀도"@ko, "Exact"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원천 데이터의 좌표 정밀도와 geometry를 일반화하지 않고 공개한 수준."@ko, "A level at which source coordinate precision and geometry are disclosed without generalization."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/generalized> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "일반화"@ko, "Generalized"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "좌표 반올림, 단순화 또는 집계를 적용해 원천보다 정밀도를 낮춘 수준."@ko, "A level with lower precision than the source after coordinate rounding, simplification or aggregation."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/administrative-area> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "행정구역"@ko, "Administrative area"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "개별 위치 대신 승인된 행정구역 코드 또는 경계까지만 공개한 수준."@ko, "A level disclosing only an approved administrative-area code or boundary instead of an individual location."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/bounding-box> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "경계 상자"@ko, "Bounding box"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원 geometry 대신 그 범위를 포함하는 최소 또는 승인된 경계 상자만 공개한 수준."@ko, "A level disclosing only a minimum or approved bounding box containing the source geometry."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/grid> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "격자"@ko, "Grid"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "개별 위치를 승인된 격자 셀 또는 셀 단위 집계값으로 바꿔 공개한 수준."@ko, "A level replacing individual locations with approved grid cells or cell-level aggregates."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/spatial-disclosure-level/withheld> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "비공개"@ko, "Withheld"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "공개 graph에 위치, 경계 상자, 중심점 또는 geometry를 제공하지 않는 수준."@ko, "A level at which no location, bounding box, centroid or geometry is supplied in the public graph."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/spatial-disclosure-level>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/term-status> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "국토교통 로컬 용어 상태"@ko, "MOLIT local-term status"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/term-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "국토교통 로컬 용어 상태"@ko, "MOLIT local-term status"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "국토교통 응용 프로파일이 직접 관리하는 용어의 검토와 사용 상태를 표시하는 후보 분류체계."@ko, "A candidate scheme indicating review and use status for terms maintained directly by the MOLIT application profile."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/deprecated>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/approved>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/approved> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/term-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "승인됨"@ko, "Approved"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "지정된 운영기관과 적용범위에서 사용하도록 승인된 상태. 승인 evidence와 유효기간을 별도로 보존한다."@ko, "Approved for use by a designated operating authority and scope; approval evidence and validity are preserved separately."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/term-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/term-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/transport-unit> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "국토교통 관측 단위"@ko, "MOLIT transport observation units"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/transport-unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "국토교통 관측 단위"@ko, "MOLIT transport observation units"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "QUDT에 차량 수를 명시한 시간당·일당 단위가 없어서 QUDT factor unit으로 정의한 국토교통 관측 단위 후보군이다."@ko, "Candidate transport-observation units defined with QUDT factor units where QUDT has no vehicle-specific hourly or daily unit."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/unit/vehicle-per-hour>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/unit/vehicle-per-day>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://qudt.org/3.4.0/vocab/unit>.
<http://qudt.org/3.4.0/vocab/unit> a <http://purl.org/dc/terms/Standard>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/unit/vehicle-per-hour> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/DerivedUnit>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/transport-unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "veh/h";
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "시간당 차량 수"@ko, "vehicle per hour"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "명시한 지점 또는 구간을 한 시간 동안 통과하거나 점유한 차량 수다. 값의 집계방법은 molit:observationAggregation으로 별도 기록한다."@ko, "Number of vehicles passing or occupying a stated site or section per hour; aggregation method is recorded separately."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/transport-unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/transport-unit>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NUM-PER-HR>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NUM-PER-HR>;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplier> 0.0002777777777777777777777777777777778;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector> <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T-1D0>;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasFactorUnit> _:n3-1418, _:n3-1419;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind> <http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/CountRate>;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol> "veh/h".
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/unit/vehicle-per-day> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/DerivedUnit>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/transport-unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "veh/d";
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "일당 차량 수"@ko, "vehicle per day"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "명시한 지점 또는 구간을 하루 동안 통과하거나 점유한 차량 수다. 1 day는 QUDT DAY를 따르며 집계 경계의 시간대는 데이터셋 설명에 기록한다."@ko, "Number of vehicles passing or occupying a stated site or section per QUDT day; the aggregation-boundary time zone is stated with the dataset."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/transport-unit>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/transport-unit>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DAY>, <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NUM>;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplier> 0.00001157407407407407407407407407407407;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector> <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T-1D0>;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasFactorUnit> _:n3-1420, _:n3-1421;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind> <http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/CountRate>;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol> "veh/d".
_:n3-1418 a <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/FactorUnit>;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/exponent> 1;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasUnit> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NUM>.
_:n3-1419 a <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/FactorUnit>;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/exponent> -1;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasUnit> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/HR>.
<http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/CountRate> a <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind>.
_:n3-1420 a <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/FactorUnit>;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/exponent> 1;
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasUnit> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NUM>.
_:n3-1421 a <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/FactorUnit>;
