    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasUnit> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DAY>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "국토교통 관측항목"@ko, "MOLIT observed properties"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "국토교통 관측항목"@ko, "MOLIT observed properties"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "국토교통 관측 데이터셋에 들어 있는 값이 나타내는 현상 또는 특성의 후보 분류체계."@ko, "A candidate scheme for phenomena or characteristics represented by values in MOLIT observation datasets."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/observed-property/traffic-volume>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/observed-property/speed>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/observed-property/travel-time>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/observed-property/facility-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/observed-property/traffic-volume> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "교통량"@ko, "Traffic volume"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "명시된 지점·구간과 집계기간을 통과하거나 점유한 차량 또는 이동 객체의 수."@ko, "The number of vehicles or moving objects passing or occupying a stated site or section during an aggregation period."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/observed-property/speed> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "속도"@ko, "Speed"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "관측대상의 이동거리를 시간으로 나눈 값. 지점속도, 구간속도와 집계방식을 별도로 기록한다."@ko, "Distance travelled by the observation subject divided by time; site speed, section speed and aggregation method are recorded separately."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/observed-property/travel-time> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "통행시간"@ko, "Travel time"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "명시된 출발점과 도착점 또는 구간을 이동하는 데 걸린 시간."@ko, "Time taken to travel between stated origin and destination points or across a stated section."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/observed-property/facility-status> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "시설 상태"@ko, "Facility status"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통시설이나 현장장비의 가동, 장애, 폐쇄 또는 점검 상태를 나타내는 값."@ko, "A value indicating the operational, failed, closed or maintenance state of transport infrastructure or field equipment."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/observed-property>.
