    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "누락되거나 유효하지 않은 관측값을 제공 데이터에서 처리하는 방식의 후보 분류체계."@ko, "A candidate scheme for handling absent or invalid observation values in supplied data."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/missing-value-policy/preserve-missing>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/missing-value-policy/explicit-code>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/missing-value-policy/exclude-from-aggregation>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/missing-value-policy/imputed>.
