    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "결측 유지"@ko, "Preserve missing"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "값을 생성하거나 대치하지 않고 원 관측의 부재를 유지하는 방식."@ko, "A policy preserving absence of a source observation without generating or replacing a value."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/missing-value-policy/explicit-code> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "명시적 결측 코드"@ko, "Explicit missing code"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "등록된 상태코드로 결측 이유를 표현하고 수치값과 구분하는 방식."@ko, "A policy representing the reason for missingness with a registered status code distinct from numeric values."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/missing-value-policy/exclude-from-aggregation> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "집계 제외"@ko, "Exclude from aggregation"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "결측 관측을 집계 계산에서 제외하고 유효 관측수 또는 coverage를 별도로 제공하는 방식."@ko, "A policy excluding missing observations from aggregation while supplying valid-observation count or coverage separately."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/missing-value-policy/imputed> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "대치"@ko, "Imputed"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "승인된 방법으로 결측값을 추정해 채우고 원 관측과 대치값을 구분하는 방식."@ko, "A policy estimating a missing value with an approved method while distinguishing imputed values from source observations."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/missing-value-policy>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "교통망 판 생명주기 상태"@ko, "Transport-network edition lifecycle status"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "교통망 판 생명주기 상태"@ko, "Transport-network edition lifecycle status"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통망 판이 식별자 해석과 조인에 사용되는 생명주기 상태의 후보 분류체계."@ko, "A candidate scheme for lifecycle states governing use of a transport-network edition in identifier resolution and joins."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-lifecycle-status/candidate>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-lifecycle-status/current>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-lifecycle-status/superseded>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-lifecycle-status/withdrawn>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-lifecycle-status/candidate> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "후보 판"@ko, "Candidate edition"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "배포 또는 기술검토 중이며 현행 조인 기준으로 승인되지 않은 교통망 판."@ko, "A network edition under distribution or technical review and not approved as the current join baseline."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-lifecycle-status/current> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "현행 판"@ko, "Current edition"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "발급기관이 명시한 유효기간 안에서 식별자 해석과 조인에 사용하는 교통망 판."@ko, "A network edition used for identifier resolution and joins within the validity period stated by its authority."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-lifecycle-status/superseded> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "대체됨"@ko, "Superseded"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "새 판으로 대체됐지만 과거 데이터의 식별자 해석과 재현을 위해 보존하는 교통망 판."@ko, "A network edition replaced by a newer edition but retained for historical identifier resolution and reproducibility."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-lifecycle-status/withdrawn> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "철회됨"@ko, "Withdrawn"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "오류, 권한 또는 무결성 사유로 신규 해석과 조인에 사용하지 않는 교통망 판."@ko, "A network edition not used for new resolution or joins because of error, authority or integrity grounds."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-lifecycle-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "데이터 스페이스 제공 준비상태"@ko, "Dataspace offering readiness status"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "데이터 스페이스 제공 준비상태"@ko, "Dataspace offering readiness status"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "발견용 제공 메타데이터의 작성과 외부 운영 자격검토 단계를 구분하는 후보 분류체계."@ko, "A candidate scheme distinguishing preparation of discovery metadata from external operational qualification."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/drafting>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/metadata-conformant>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/qualification-pending>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/operationally-qualified>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/suspended>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/withdrawn>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/drafting> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "메타데이터 작성 중"@ko, "Metadata drafting"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "제공 메타데이터를 작성 중이며 profile 적합성이나 운영 자격을 아직 판정하지 않은 상태."@ko, "Offering metadata is being prepared and neither profile conformance nor operational qualification has been decided."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/metadata-conformant> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "메타데이터 적합"@ko, "Metadata conformant"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "선택한 Application Profile 기술검증을 통과했지만 제공 권한과 Connector 준비상태는 판정하지 않은 상태."@ko, "The selected Application Profile technical validation passed, while provider authority and connector readiness remain undecided."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/qualification-pending> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "운영 자격검토 대기"@ko, "Operational qualification pending"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "승인된 외부 registry에서 제공 권한, 위임, 유효기간과 전송 준비상태를 검토 중인 상태."@ko, "Provider authority, delegation, validity and transfer readiness are under review in an approved external registry."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/operationally-qualified> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "운영 자격 확인"@ko, "Operationally qualified"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "승인된 외부 registry의 유효한 evidence로 제공 권한과 운영 준비상태를 확인한 상태. RDF 유형 또는 SHACL 통과만으로 이 값을 부여할 수 없다."@ko, "Provider authority and operational readiness were confirmed by valid evidence in an approved external registry. RDF typing or SHACL conformance alone cannot assign this value."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/suspended> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "제공 중단"@ko, "Suspended"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "자격, 보안, 품질 또는 운영 사유로 신규 계약과 전송을 일시 중단한 상태."@ko, "New contracts and transfers are temporarily suspended for qualification, security, quality or operational reasons."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/offering-readiness-status/withdrawn> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Withdrawn"@en, "제공 철회"@ko;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "제공 후보를 철회해 신규 발견, 계약과 전송에 사용하지 않는 상태."@ko, "The offering candidate has been withdrawn and is not used for new discovery, contracts or transfers."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/offering-readiness-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "품질 평가 방법 유형"@ko, "Quality evaluation method types"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "품질 평가 방법 유형"@ko, "Quality evaluation method types"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "품질 측정값을 산출한 방법의 일반 유형을 구분하는 후보 분류체계. 실제 알고리즘, 표본설계와 매개변수는 판이 있는 별도 방법 문서로 기록한다."@ko, "A candidate scheme distinguishing general types of methods used to produce quality measurements. Actual algorithms, sample designs and parameters are recorded in a separate versioned method document."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-evaluation-method/whole-population>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-evaluation-method/sample-based>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-evaluation-method/rule-based>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-evaluation-method/reference-comparison>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-evaluation-method/self-diagnostic>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-evaluation-method/whole-population> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "전수 평가"@ko, "Whole-population evaluation"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "명시된 평가 범위의 모든 레코드 또는 요소에 평가규칙을 적용한 방법."@ko, "A method applying evaluation rules to every record or element in the stated evaluation scope."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-evaluation-method/sample-based> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "표본 평가"@ko, "Sample-based evaluation"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "모집단에서 명시된 표본설계로 추출한 일부 레코드 또는 요소를 평가한 방법."@ko, "A method evaluating a subset of records or elements selected from a population by a stated sample design."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-evaluation-method/rule-based> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "규칙 기반 평가"@ko, "Rule-based evaluation"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "schema, 무결성 규칙 또는 도메인 제약의 통과 여부를 계산한 방법."@ko, "A method calculating conformance with schema, integrity rules or domain constraints."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-evaluation-method/reference-comparison> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "기준자료 비교"@ko, "Reference comparison"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "판과 신뢰수준이 명시된 기준자료에 관측 또는 제공값을 비교한 방법."@ko, "A method comparing observed or supplied values with reference data having a stated edition and confidence level."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>.
