    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "자체 진단"@ko, "Self-diagnostic"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "센서, 장비 또는 원천시스템이 제공한 자체 상태와 진단 결과를 사용한 방법."@ko, "A method using health and diagnostic results supplied by a sensor, device or source system itself."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-evaluation-method>.
