    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "품질 결과 유형"@ko, "Quality result kinds"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "품질 결과 유형"@ko, "Quality result kinds"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "품질 결과의 값 표현 유형을 구분하는 후보 분류체계."@ko, "A candidate scheme distinguishing value-representation kinds for quality results."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-result-kind/quantitative>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-result-kind/boolean>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-result-kind/categorical>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-result-kind/descriptive>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-result-kind/quantitative> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "수치 결과"@ko, "Quantitative result"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "단위와 함께 해석하는 수치 품질 결과."@ko, "A numeric quality result interpreted together with a unit."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-result-kind/boolean> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "논리 결과"@ko, "Boolean result"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "명시된 조건의 참 또는 거짓으로 표현한 품질 결과."@ko, "A quality result represented as true or false for a stated condition."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-result-kind/categorical> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "범주 결과"@ko, "Categorical result"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "승인된 코드 또는 등급 분류에서 선택한 품질 결과."@ko, "A quality result selected from an approved code or grade classification."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-result-kind/descriptive> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "서술 결과"@ko, "Descriptive result"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "구조화된 수치나 코드로 축약하지 않은 설명형 품질 결과."@ko, "A narrative quality result not reduced to a structured number or code."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-result-kind>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "품질 매핑 손실 처리"@ko, "Quality mapping loss dispositions"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "품질 매핑 손실 처리"@ko, "Quality mapping loss dispositions"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원천 품질 요소를 DQV projection으로 변환할 때의 정보 보존과 역변환 상태를 구분하는 후보 분류체계."@ko, "A candidate scheme distinguishing information preservation and reversibility when a source quality element is projected to DQV."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/lossless>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/reversible-loss>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/irreversible-loss>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/unmapped>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/not-published>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/lossless> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "무손실"@ko, "Lossless"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원천 의미와 값을 대상 표현에서 모두 보존해 승인된 역변환이 가능한 매핑."@ko, "A mapping preserving source meaning and value in the target representation with an approved reverse mapping."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/reversible-loss> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "별도 원문으로 복원 가능"@ko, "Reversible with retained source"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "대상 projection은 일부 의미를 생략하지만 보존한 원문과 loss ledger로 복원할 수 있는 매핑."@ko, "A mapping whose target projection omits some meaning that can be restored from retained source content and a loss ledger."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/irreversible-loss> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "비가역 손실"@ko, "Irreversible loss"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "대상 projection에서 원천 의미 또는 값을 복원할 수 없는 매핑."@ko, "A mapping from whose target projection the source meaning or value cannot be reconstructed."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/unmapped> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "미매핑"@ko, "Unmapped"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "대상 품질 측정항목을 정하지 못해 원천 요소를 projection하지 않은 상태."@ko, "A state in which the source element is not projected because no target quality metric has been determined."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-loss-disposition/not-published> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "게시 제외"@ko, "Not published"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "보안, 권리 또는 공개정책에 따라 원천 요소를 공개 projection에서 제외한 상태."@ko, "A state in which the source element is excluded from the public projection under security, rights or publication policy."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-loss-disposition>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/organization> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "국내 기관 식별자 후보 registry"@ko, "Candidate Korean organization identifier registry"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/organization>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "국내 기관 식별자 후보 registry"@ko, "Candidate Korean organization identifier registry"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "기관 식별자 발급원, 합병, 폐지, 위임과 Provider authority 연결을 검토하기 위한 후보 registry. 운영기관 승인 전에는 공개 Dataset의 권위 기관 IRI로 사용할 수 없다."@ko, "A candidate registry for reviewing issuer, merger, closure, delegation and provider-authority links for organization identifiers. It cannot be used as an authoritative organization IRI for public datasets before operating-authority approval."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/organization-molit>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/organization-molit> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/organization>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "MOLIT-CANDIDATE";
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "국토교통부 후보 기관 레코드"@ko, "Candidate MOLIT organization record"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "기관 URI 발급, 조직개편 이력과 위임 evidence 구조를 시험하기 위한 후보 레코드. 행정표준기관코드 또는 승인된 Provider Participant 식별자를 주장하지 않는다."@ko, "A candidate record for testing organization-IRI issuance, reorganization history and delegation evidence. It does not assert a Korean administrative organization code or an approved Provider Participant identifier."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/organization>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/organization>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "국내 행정구역 식별자 후보 registry"@ko, "Candidate Korean administrative-area identifier registry"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "국내 행정구역 식별자 후보 registry"@ko, "Candidate Korean administrative-area identifier registry"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "행정동, 법정동, 기관코드의 scheme과 기준일을 구분해 검토하기 위한 후보 registry. code 위치나 명칭만으로 서로 다른 scheme을 결합하지 않는다."@ko, "A candidate registry for reviewing administrative-dong, legal-dong and organization-code schemes with reference dates. Different schemes are not joined by code position or label alone."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/mois-kik-h>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/mois-kik-b>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/kr-admin-org>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/mois-kik-h> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "MOIS_KIK_H";
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "행정동·주민등록 행정기관코드 scheme 후보"@ko, "Candidate administrative-dong and resident-registration authority code scheme"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "10자리 행정동·주민등록 행정기관코드를 수용하기 위한 scheme 후보. 개별 코드의 권위 IRI와 유효기간은 아직 발급하지 않는다."@ko, "A candidate scheme slot for ten-character administrative-dong and resident-registration authority codes; authoritative IRIs and validity for individual codes are not yet issued."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/mois-kik-b> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "MOIS_KIK_B";
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "법정동코드 scheme 후보"@ko, "Candidate legal-dong code scheme"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "10자리 법정동코드를 수용하기 위한 scheme 후보. 행정동코드와 같은 식별공간으로 취급하지 않는다."@ko, "A candidate scheme slot for ten-character legal-dong codes; it is not treated as the same identifier space as administrative-dong codes."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/kr-admin-org> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "KR_ADMIN_ORG";
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "행정표준기관코드 scheme 후보"@ko, "Candidate Korean administrative organization code scheme"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "7자리 행정표준기관코드를 수용하기 위한 scheme 후보. 행정구역 경계나 법정동을 식별하는 코드로 사용하지 않는다."@ko, "A candidate scheme slot for seven-character Korean administrative organization codes; it is not used to identify administrative boundaries or legal dongs."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/administrative-area>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/legal-resource> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "국내 법령·행정규칙 식별자 후보 registry"@ko, "Candidate Korean legal-resource identifier registry"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/legal-resource>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "국내 법령·행정규칙 식별자 후보 registry"@ko, "Candidate Korean legal-resource identifier registry"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "법령과 행정규칙의 발급원, 공포번호, 개정판, 시행일과 폐지상태를 함께 보존하기 위한 빈 후보 registry. 승인된 식별자 정책 전에는 개별 법령 concept를 발급하지 않는다."@ko, "An empty candidate registry intended to preserve issuer, promulgation number, amendment edition, effective date and repeal status for laws and administrative rules. No individual legal-resource concepts are issued before approval of an identifier policy."@en.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/kogl-license> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "공공누리 이용조건 후보 registry"@ko, "Candidate KOGL licence-condition registry"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-07-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/term-status/candidate>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0-rc.1";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/scheme/kogl-license>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "공공누리 이용조건 후보 registry"@ko, "Candidate KOGL licence-condition registry"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "공공누리 제0유형, 제1~4유형과 AI유형을 검토하기 위한 후보 registry. 이 concept는 dct:LicenseDocument가 아니며 공식 증서 URI, 지속성, 판과 폐지정책 승인 뒤에만 license 값으로 승격할 수 있다."@ko, "A candidate registry for reviewing KOGL Type 0, Types 1–4 and the AI type. Its concepts are not dct:LicenseDocument resources and can become licence values only after approval of official deed IRIs, persistence, editions and retirement policy."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/kogl-type-0>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/kogl-type-1>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/kogl-type-2>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/kogl-type-3>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/kogl-type-4>, <https://data.molit.go.kr/candidate/concept/kogl-ai-type>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www.kogl.or.kr/info/license.do>.
